  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Expand access to the most Vulnerable refugees and host community s school aged children in Erbil Governorate, Iraq</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Establishing an integrated model school for Syrian refugee students in local shcools and introducing Refugee-integrated education in Iraq Kurd Region for peace building(training talented student, preventing extremism, and contributing to regional peace building process / HDP NEXUS project which aims to enhance education quality and regional peace building on an integrated perspective)1. &#xB09C;&#xBBFC;&#xD1B5;&#xD569;&#xAD50;&#xC721; &#xAD50;&#xC721;&#xAE30;&#xD68C; &#xD655;&#xB300;
2. &#xD559;&#xAD50;&#xC640; &#xC9C0;&#xC5ED;&#xC0AC;&#xD68C; &#xB0B4; &#xC591;&#xC9C8;&#xC758; &#xB09C;&#xBBFC;&#xD1B5;&#xD569;&#xAD50;&#xC721; &#xC5ED;&#xB7C9;&#xAC15;&#xD654;</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In line with Intergrated Educaiton Policy, which is designed by Iraq Kurd Regional Government, the project establishes an integrated model school that covers primary, middle, high shool with an newly adopted education policy. In addition, the project is aimed at renovating 41 schools in KRG jundicial provinces and etablishes a model library of the integrated school with the new education curriculum.</narrative>
  </description>
